==German==

===Etymology===
From {{der|de|gml|pumpe}}, {{m|gml|pompe}}, from {{der|de|dum|pompe}}. Further origin uncertain, but probably onomatopoeic. Compare {{cog|en|pump}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈpʊmpə/|lang=de}}
* {{audio|De-Pumpe.ogg|Audio|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|f||Pumpen}}

# [[pump]]
# {{lb|de|colloquial}} [[heart]]
#: {{ux|de|Die '''Pumpe''' will nicht mehr so wie früher.|My '''heart''' isn’t working like it used to.}}

